---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms" description="Terms of service for working with Amplivate.">
  <section class="legal">
    <div class="container legal__inner">
      <span class="eyebrow">Terms</span>
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="legal__updated">Last updated: [date]</p>

      <p class="legal__notice">
        This is a draft structure, not a substitute for legal advice. Please have it reviewed
        by a solicitor before launch, and fill in the bracketed details below.
      </p>

      <h2>Services</h2>
      <p>
        Amplivate provides digital marketing services including SEO, Google Business Profile
        management, website design, branding, advertising management, and AI-powered tools,
        as agreed with each client individually.
      </p>

      <h2>Plans and billing</h2>
      <p>
        Monthly plans are billed [state billing cycle/method]. Plans run month-to-month with
        no long-term contract unless otherwise agreed in writing.
      </p>

      <h2>Cancellation</h2>
      <p>[State notice period required to cancel a plan.]</p>

      <h2>Website ownership</h2>
      <p>
        For website design projects, ownership of the final site, its content, and any
        associated domain transfers to the client on full payment, unless otherwise agreed.
      </p>

      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        While we work to agreed strategies and industry good practice, we cannot guarantee
        specific search rankings, ad performance, or business outcomes, as these depend on
        factors outside our control, including third-party platforms like Google.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about these terms can be sent to
        <a href="mailto:hello@amplivate.co.uk">hello@amplivate.co.uk</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal {
    padding-block: clamp(4rem, 10vw, 6rem) var(--section-padding);
  }

  .legal__inner {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .legal h1 {
    font-size: var(--step-2xl);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .legal__updated {
    color: var(--color-slate-blue);
    font-size: var(--step-sm);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .legal__notice {
    background: var(--color-bg-subtle);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-size: var(--step-sm);
    color: var(--color-slate-blue);
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .legal h2 {
    font-size: var(--step-lg);
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .legal p {
    color: var(--color-slate-blue);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .legal a {
    color: var(--color-accent-strong);
  }
</style>
